WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.610
- Hello, I'm Ewan McGregor
and I play Christopher Robin.

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:04.680
And today I'm taking the BuzzFeed quiz

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.823
Which Winnie The Pooh Character Are You?

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:09.940
So, the first question is how
do you like to eat your honey?

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.570
Straight out of the jar, on your toast,

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.313
on your pizza, on your pancakes,
on your fruit, in your tea.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.480
I would take it straight out of the jar.

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:19.540
How would your best friend describe you?

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.340
Ambitious, optimistic, introverted,

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:24.870
loving, hilarious, adventurous.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:26.713
I think probably adventurous.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:29.700
- Oh, that would be telling.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.010
I wouldn't be so indiscreet as to say.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:35.063
Choose a Disney princess to
join you on an adventure.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:37.960
For the sake of my daughters,
it's gonna have to be Elsa.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.910
How do you like to spend your free time?

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:42.950
Cooking, exercising, hanging
out with friends and family,

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:45.893
watching TV, traveling, sleeping.

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:47.360
Oh, the truth is there's
a quite of few of those.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.150
There's sleeping, traveling,

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:51.010
and hanging out with friends and family.

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.180
So I'm gonna have to
choose between those three.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:55.500
I'm gonna choose hanging
out with friends and family.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.790
And then describe your laugh in one word.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:02.700
Deep, infectious, loud, soft,
rambunctious, or maniacal.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:05.313
I would like to hope it was infectious.

00:01:05.471 --> 00:01:07.480
(drum rolling)

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:09.013
You got Winnie-the-Pooh.

00:01:09.258 --> 00:01:10.130
Hey!

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.800
Oh, hunny, you're a
highly curious individual

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:15.363
who is equal parts lovable and charming.

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:16.880
You're a thoughtful person who knows

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:18.450
exactly how to turn someone's day

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.093
from dreadful to wonderful.

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:21.500
Friends stick to you like honey

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.603
because there's no one else
quite like you, Winnie-the-Pooh!

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:27.090
Oh, I'm delighted I got
Winnie, 'cause he's my man.

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:29.393
I think they got it absolutely right.

00:01:29.865 --> 00:01:30.790
(laughs)

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:31.623
I would hope so.

00:01:32.015 --> 00:01:34.515
(light music)

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:38.078
(creaking)

